{
Fact values Identified by String.

Open Fact open-type Identified by values.

Fact derived-type Identified by values
  Holds when open-type(values)

Fact enumerated-type Identified by String
  Holds when derived-type(enumerated-type).

+values(A).
+open-type(A).
}
?open-type(A).
Extend Fact enumerated-type Identified by A,B,C.
?enumerated-type(A).
?!enumerated-type(B).
?!enumerated-type(C).
